        {
          "page": 4,
          "section": null,
          "quote": "The equiatomic TaHfZrTi HEA was selected as our prototype alloy and the content of the bcc stabilizer element, i.e., Ta,[34-35] was gradually reduced in order to destabilize the bcc phase in the HEA system (TaxHfZrTi, denoted as Tax hereafter).",
          "table": null,
          "figure": null,
          "chunk_id": "3952ef227431ec37:part:001"
        }
      ]
    }
